     "titulo": "〜ところが: however",
     "texto": [
      "To tell something that didn't go as you expected: **でんわ を かけました。 ところが、 でませんでした** (I called. However, nobody answered).",
      "It goes at the start of the second sentence, followed by a comma."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜どころか: far from; not only that",
     "texto": [
      "It presents a reality that contradicts or goes beyond what was expected: **やさしい どころか、 とても きびしい です** (far from being kind, they are very strict). It can follow nouns, adjectives or verb forms; the structure depends on the word before it."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
